{"name":"附表二十二之二","title":"乾癬性周邊關節炎使用DMARDs標準目標劑量及有效治療劑量的定義","updated":"","url":"https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/dl-42704-0d36edbeb60c45d58bfdbf63363e4620-1.pdf","extractor_version":3,"formlines_version":1,"clauses":[{"text":"1","level":0},{"text":"附表二十二之二：乾癬性周邊關節炎使用DMARDs 標準目標劑量及有效治療劑量","level":0},{"text":"的定義","level":0},{"text":"(1) 符合標準疾病修飾類藥物(DMARDs)療法失敗的定義之前，應達到使用的標準目標劑量","level":0},{"text":"(standard target doses)：","level":0},{"text":"","level":0},{"text":"Sulphasalazine 2 g/天 (分次使用)","level":0},{"text":"","level":0},{"text":"Methotrexate  15 mg/週","level":0},{"text":"","level":0},{"text":"Cyclosporine  3-5 mg/kg/天","level":0},{"text":"","level":0},{"text":"Leflunomide  20 mg/天","level":0},{"text":"(2) 疾病修飾類藥物(DMARDs)有效治療劑量(therapeutic doses)的定義：","level":0},{"text":"","level":0},{"text":"Sulphasalazine  1-2 g/天 (分次使用)","level":0},{"text":"","level":0},{"text":"Methotrexate   7.5 mg/週","level":0},{"text":"","level":0},{"text":"Cyclosporine   3 mg/kg/天","level":0},{"text":"","level":0},{"text":"Leflunomide   10 mg/天","level":0}],"tables":[],"tables_spliced":0,"visible_chars":358,"rejected":[]}